						<r3d:remarks>In the framework the EOSC Node, the French Research Infrastructure Data Terra has established a shared vision and collaborative strategy with NFDI4Earth, a key initiative of Germany’s National Research Data Infrastructure (NFDI). This collaboration aims to strengthen the European federation’s capabilities for managing and integrating Earth system, environmental, and biodiversity data, while fostering the adoption of advanced, knowledge-driven technologies.</r3d:remarks>
